00:08:50,640 --> 00:08:53,440
That at the bare minimum I think is a good way to start.

183
00:08:58,260 --> 00:09:01,060
- I'll reiterate what the Chancellor said this morning

184
00:09:01,950 --> 00:09:05,190
at the opening keynote session in the theater,

185
00:09:05,190 --> 00:09:08,160
which is we need to have an understanding

186
00:09:08,160 --> 00:09:09,870
that we're promoting a culture

187
00:09:09,870 --> 00:09:11,520
