1323
00:59:59,340 --> 01:00:03,150
And so that was something that was very interesting,

1324
01:00:03,150 --> 01:00:04,890
because I'm like, well, we're in higher ed,

1325
01:00:04,890 --> 01:00:07,020
and we're telling students not to do that,

1326
01:00:07,020 --> 01:00:09,660
but here we have industry that's saying

1327
01:00:09,660 --> 01:00:12,180
this is what they're gonna need to do the report.

1328
01:00:12,180 --> 01:00:14,640
And even in the medical field,

1329
01:00:14,640 --> 01:00:19,640
it was just amazing to see how AI is saving lives.

1330
01:00:20,310 --> 01:00:23,940
And I kind of reflected on being stuck.

1331
01:00:23,940 --> 01:00:26,490
You know, we're stuck in these spots,

1332
01:00:26,490 --> 01:00:30,120
